{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01Vk7QbXmVVaR6sHmfqcUq1u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ct9XhCX1PVaBEow5CVFZU5","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","old_string":"- **sos_1:** With exactly one legal graveyard target the trigger auto-casts without prompting (per TODO); the \"may\" decline is only offered when there are 2+ candidates, via a single `choose_card` where `None` declines.","new_string":"- **sos_1:** With exactly one legal graveyard target the trigger auto-casts without prompting (per TODO); the \"may\" decline is only offered when there are 2+ candidates, via a single `choose_card` where `None` declines.\n- **sos_257:** Restricted mana = separate `_restricted_pool` bucket in `ManaPool`; `can_pay`/`pay` gained a keyword-only `include_restricted` flag (default False — existing callers unaffected) set by `cast_spell` for instant/sorcery. Restricted mana is spent before regular mana of the same type. Limitation: restricted mana is not offered to activated-ability costs or hybrid-only payments outside the casting pipeline.\n- **sos_257:** Animation mutates in place and folds CREATURE into `_original_card_types` (the effect has no duration), so continuous-effect reset cycles don't un-animate. The animated land is never summoning sick (it has been on the battlefield; a land played and animated the same turn could attack — accepted simplification, commented in code). Pump is an until-EOT `ContinuousEffect` (7c) + immediate `apply_all`."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1253,"cache_read_input_tokens":216797,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1253},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use