ying the mana cost is still casting; only `copy_spell` copies are not cast. Shared helper `_fire_spell_cast_event` in `engine/casting.py`.\n- **sos_1:** `AttacksTriggeredEvent` existed but was never fired (FDN attack-trigger cards were dormant); now fired per declared attacker in `declare_attackers_step` — additive, no existing engine test exercised it.\n- **sos_1:** `move_to_zone` only consults replacement effects for battlefield exits, so \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\" could not work via the documented seam. Added `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (subclass of `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent`) consulted in `_resolve_spell` for the instant/sorcery branch. Limitation: spells countered via card-local `_counter_spell` helpers (fdn_48 pattern) bypass `move_to_zone`, so exile-instead does not apply to a countered freecast spell — edge case accepted.\n- **sos_1:** With exactly one legal graveyard target the trigger auto-casts without prompting (per TODO); the \"may\" decline is only offered when there are 2+ candidates, via a single `choose_card` where `None` declines.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":4,"oldLines":3,"newStart":4,"newLines":5,"lines":[" - **sos_1:** `AttacksTriggeredEvent` existed but was never fired (FDN attack-trigger cards were dormant); now fired per declared attacker in `declare_attackers_step` — additive, no existing engine test exercised it."," - **sos_1:** `move_to_zone` only consults replacement effects for battlefield exits, so \"if that spell would be put into your graveyard, exile it instead\" could not work via the documented seam. Added `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` (subclass of `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent`) consulted in `_resolve_spell` for the instant/sorcery branch. Limitation: spells countered via card-local `_counter_spell` helpers (fdn_48 pattern) bypass `move_to_zone`, so exile-instead does not apply to a countered freecast spell — edge case accepted."," - **sos_1:** With exactly one legal graveyard target the trigger auto-casts without prompting (per TODO); the \"may\" decline is only offered when there are 2+ candidates, via a single `choose_card` where `None` declines.","+- **sos_257:** Restricted mana = separate `_restricted_pool` bucket in `ManaPool`; `can_pay`/`pay` gained a keyword-only `include_restricted` flag (default False — existing callers unaffected) set by `cast_spell` for instant/sorcery. Restricted mana is spent before regular mana of the same type. Limitation: restricted mana is not offered to activated-ability costs or hybrid-only payments outside the casting pipeline.","+- **sos_257:** Animation mutates in place and folds CREATURE into `_original_card_types` (the effect has no duration), so continuous-effect reset cycles don't un-animate. The animated land is never summoning sick (it has been on the battlefield; a land played and animated the same turn could attack — accepted simplification, commented in code). Pump is an until-EOT `ContinuousEffect` (7c) + immediate `apply_all`."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
