{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_017sBSJrTsKYAwGkpaW1WQdt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VWUA9KhiP9sY4jkA3EJuPd","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np = \"TODO.md\"\ns = open(p).read()\ns = s.replace(\"- [ ] **sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian**\", \"- [x] **sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian**\")\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\np = \"KEY_DECISIONS.md\"\ns = open(p).read()\ns += \"\"\"- **sos_201:** Miracle is card-local: the trigger condition itself counts draws per turn on the Lorehold instance (`_draws_seen[turn]`), since the engine's `cards_drawn_this_turn` never resets. Limitation (commented): draws made before Lorehold entered the battlefield that turn are not counted, so a later draw could wrongly be \"first\" — only observable when Lorehold enters mid-turn after a draw. Miracle cast = pay {2} + `cast_spell_free(..., Zone.HAND)`; no prompt is offered when {2} cannot be paid.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_201: Lorehold, the Historian\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Mark TODO, log decisions, commit sos_201"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1202,"cache_read_input_tokens":291993,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1202},"output_tokens":67,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91030fde-ab39-43e5-99c8-7491eecaa6bd","uuid":"ad3a0322-f3bd-4dba-87e9-3cc1e8c090ca","request_id":"req_011CbuxFaCku26635NNMaH4c"}
