{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01HiMZpqx7cVFSY3GrZYRrzC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0136GRX59RLNTQEhWPTc4A7q","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np = \"TODO.md\"\ns = open(p).read()\ns = s.replace(\"- [ ] **sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer**\", \"- [x] **sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer**\")\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\np = \"KEY_DECISIONS.md\"\ns = open(p).read()\ns += \"\"\"- **sos_97:** Loyalty effects read targets from `self.chosen_targets` (set by the activator before activation — `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` carries no target list, so there is no engine plumbing that could set it). Surveil keeps cards in their original relative order (no reorder choice — commented simplification). Skip-turns: `Player.skip_turns` counter consumed at turn rotation in `advance_phase` (a skipped turn never happens; works with the extra-turns queue). Coin flips use `game.rng` (`random.Random`), created lazily if absent so tests can seed it.\n\"\"\"\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_97: Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Mark TODO, log decisions, commit sos_97"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1255,"cache_read_input_tokens":312304,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1255},"output_tokens":66,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"91030fde-ab39-43e5-99c8-7491eecaa6bd","uuid":"0761eaec-76cf-45d8-af48-5c6176ca6527","request_id":"req_011CbuxZHpmCsoEbVKHKvREQ"}
